@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = replace-after-login
@refreshToken = replace-after-login
@invitationCode = copy-from-mailpit

### API readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Swagger document
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "correct horse battery staple",
  "client": {
    "type": "swagger",
    "version": "1.0"
  }
}

### Refresh (the old refresh token becomes invalid immediately)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Current profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create an offline Revit grant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/plugin/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product": "revit",
  "pluginVersion": "2026.1.0",
  "installationId": "0f09e7a2-d292-4d3e-96be-4e7b193ce879"
}

### Public signing keys
GET {{baseUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json

### Send plugin usage telemetry (safe to retry with the same eventId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/plugin/telemetry/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product": "revit",
  "pluginVersion": "2026.1.0",
  "hostVersion": "2026",
  "installationId": "0f09e7a2-d292-4d3e-96be-4e7b193ce879",
  "events": [
    {
      "eventId": "da8ffdb8-1683-4c09-bba5-07099a1be779",
      "command": "export.ifc",
      "occurredAt": "2026-08-07T13:20:45Z",
      "durationMs": 1850,
      "outcome": "succeeded",
      "errorCode": null
    }
  ]
}

### Organization telemetry summary (OrganizationAdmin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/telemetry/summary?product=revit&command=export.ifc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
